## Goal
Perform a principal component analysis of the gene count matrix to visualize sample relationships and identify patterns driven by experimental condition. The analysis will reduce the high-dimensional gene expression data to its principal components, plot samples in PC1-PC2 space colored by condition (untreated vs. treated), and report the variance explained by each component.

